Package: lx-netns-tools
Version: 0.1.4
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: bash, bubblewrap, util-linux
Maintainer: Jonathan Wagner <dustyhair@gmail.com>
Description: private network namespace tools for SmartOS LX zones
 lx-bwrap reads the private VNIC pool assigned by the SmartOS LX brand,
 creates a bubblewrap network namespace, claims one VNIC, configures its IPv4
 address and default route, and removes its setup capabilities before running
 the requested command.
